{"sba-sakura-39110":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n こんばんは\n \n \n 今日も１日お疲れ様です。\n \n \n この間マネージャーさんの\n 素敵なカメラでちょっと遊びました。‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSE7FQJDWG7G1KNJ8SCY8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSF6J92F5EGB971JM75SK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSG7T45NABB25XXCM9EM1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSH8M0FVG0A966QPR9A9D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 小さい頃からまともに撮るんじゃなくて\n ちょっとカメラで遊びながら撮るのが好きです\n \n \n 特に寄るのが好き。‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n そういえば皆さん、\n 櫻坂の新しいオフィシャルグッズ\n 見てくださりましたか??\n \n \n Tシャツは種類が豊富なので\n すごい迷っちゃいますね。🤔\n \n \n BANのロングスリーブTシャツCの\n ちょこっと映っている髪を見て、\n \n \n 「誰だろう～?」なんてね、\n はぶちゃんと話したりして。\n \n \n 個人的にはシンプルな\n BANのTシャツが好きです🌸\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSJ7NFTX1ZM6G7VB5VKEB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSK8SMA8B4W3B9VTMEMFW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n シンプルだけど、\n 文字の存在感が強くて。\n \n \n 皆さんはどれが気になっていますか??\n \n \n 是非、チェックしてくださいね‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0KSM9NM73T0B8HQ4G729YX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n みい。             "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-sakura-36468":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             こんにちは 武元唯衣です🕊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/8  1stシングル発売前日に「デビューカウントダウンライブ‼︎」を開催することが発表されましたね🌸櫻坂46として記念すべき初ライブ、是非一緒に同じ時を過ごしましょう！日々自分を磨いてその日まで頑張りたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYTSXXCM8DV7P1VAFPMTF3P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　　◯お知らせです11/11 19:00〜 TBS「東大王」さんに出演させていただきます！　　4度目の出演となります。本当にありがたいです。　\nこんなにも温かい場所があるのかと思うくらい、優しく言葉をかけて下さる共演者の皆様に囲まれて、いつも楽しく収録に臨んでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちを力に変えて頑張ってきました！ぜひぜひ見てください😌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYTSYXV8MFDBDKZEPJRJ0AN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　\n差し入れでいただいたアンパンとプリン、とっても美味しかったです❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして11日は、東大王の後に松田が出演するミラクル9さんも放送されますね＾＾連続だなんて、、嬉しいです。　是非2時間続けてご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　　またね❕             "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33437":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうは時間がないから\nツーショット祭り！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/20/0693385/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/20/0693385/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/20/0693385/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-3026":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のミニ握手会では\n北海道におじゃまするよ(。・ω・。)ノいえーい\nなんと!!初めての北海道♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"